{
  "savedAt": "2026-08-10T15:21:11.194Z",
  "bodyHTML": "<p data-paragraph=\"1\"><span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"邑\" data-note=\"县、地方。\" title=\"县、地方。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“邑”的词典解释\"><ruby>邑<rt>yì</rt></ruby></span></span>有王生,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"行七\" data-note=\"排行第七。\" title=\"排行第七。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“行七”的词典解释\"><ruby>行七<rt>háng qī</rt></ruby></span></span>,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"故家子\" data-note=\"旧时世家子弟。\" title=\"旧时世家子弟。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“故家子”的词典解释\"><ruby>故家子<rt>gù jiā zǐ</rt></ruby></span></span>。少<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"慕道\" data-note=\"仰慕道术或道家修行。\" title=\"仰慕道术或道家修行。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“慕道”的词典解释\"><ruby>慕道<rt>mù dào</rt></ruby></span></span>,闻<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"劳山\" data-note=\"即崂山，山东名山；古籍中常写作“劳山”。\" title=\"即崂山，山东名山；古籍中常写作“劳山”。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“劳山”的词典解释\"><ruby>劳山<rt>láo shān</rt></ruby></span></span>多仙人,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"负笈\" data-note=\"背着书箱；指外出求学。\" title=\"背着书箱；指外出求学。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“负笈”的词典解释\"><ruby>负笈<rt>fù jí</rt></ruby></span></span>往游。<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"登\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“登”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：dēng 古代盛放祭品的礼器。\">登</span>一顶,有<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"观宇\" data-note=\"道观建筑。\" title=\"道观建筑。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“观宇”的词典解释\"><ruby>观宇<rt>guàn yǔ</rt></ruby></span></span>,甚幽。一道士坐<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"蒲团\" data-note=\"僧道打坐用的圆垫。\" title=\"僧道打坐用的圆垫。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“蒲团”的词典解释\"><ruby>蒲团<rt>pú tuán</rt></ruby></span></span>上,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"素发\" data-note=\"白发。\" title=\"白发。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“素发”的词典解释\"><ruby>素发<rt>sù fà</rt></ruby></span></span>垂领,而<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"神观\" data-note=\"神态、仪表。\" title=\"神态、仪表。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“神观”的词典解释\"><ruby>神观<rt>shén guān</rt></ruby></span></span><span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"爽迈\" data-note=\"爽朗超逸。\" title=\"爽朗超逸。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“爽迈”的词典解释\"><ruby>爽迈<rt>shuǎng mài</rt></ruby></span></span>。<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"叩\" data-note=\"询问、拜见。\" title=\"询问、拜见。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“叩”的词典解释\"><ruby>叩<rt>kòu</rt></ruby></span></span>而与语,理甚<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"玄妙\" data-note=\"深奥微妙。\" title=\"深奥微妙。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“玄妙”的词典解释\"><ruby>玄妙<rt>xuán miào</rt></ruby></span></span>。<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"请师之\" data-note=\"请求拜他为师。\" title=\"请求拜他为师。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“请师之”的词典解释\"><ruby>请师之<rt>qǐng shī zhī</rt></ruby></span></span>。道士曰:“恐<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"娇惰\" data-note=\"娇气懒惰。\" title=\"娇气懒惰。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“娇惰”的词典解释\"><ruby>娇惰<rt>jiāo duò</rt></ruby></span></span>不能作苦。”答言:“能之。”其门人甚众,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"薄暮\" data-note=\"傍晚。\" title=\"傍晚。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“薄暮”的词典解释\"><ruby>薄暮<rt>bó mù</rt></ruby></span></span>毕集。王俱与<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"稽首\" data-note=\"古代跪拜礼。\" title=\"古代跪拜礼。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“稽首”的词典解释\"><ruby>稽首<rt>qǐ shǒu</rt></ruby></span></span>,遂留观中。<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"凌晨\" data-note=\"天快亮时。\" title=\"天快亮时。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“凌晨”的词典解释\"><ruby>凌晨<rt>líng chén</rt></ruby></span></span>,道士呼王去,授以斧,使随众<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"采樵\" data-note=\"砍柴。\" title=\"砍柴。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“采樵”的词典解释\"><ruby>采樵<rt>cǎi qiáo</rt></ruby></span></span>。王谨受教。过月<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"馀\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“馀”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：yú 同“余”，多、剩余。\">馀</span>,手足<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"重茧\" data-note=\"厚茧；形容手脚磨损。\" title=\"厚茧；形容手脚磨损。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“重茧”的词典解释\"><ruby>重茧<rt>chóng jiǎn</rt></ruby></span></span>,不堪其苦,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"阴\" data-note=\"暗中、私下。\" title=\"暗中、私下。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“阴”的词典解释\"><ruby>阴<rt>yīn</rt></ruby></span></span>有<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"归志\" data-note=\"回家的念头。\" title=\"回家的念头。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“归志”的词典解释\"><ruby>归志<rt>guī zhì</rt></ruby></span></span>。\n一夕归,见二人与师<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"共酌\" data-note=\"一起饮酒。\" title=\"一起饮酒。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“共酌”的词典解释\"><ruby>共酌<rt>gòng zhuó</rt></ruby></span></span>,日已暮,尚无灯烛。师<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"乃\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“乃”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：nǎi 古文代词或连词，文中多作你们的、于是等义。\">乃</span><span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"翦\" data-note=\"同“剪”。\" title=\"同“剪”。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“翦”的词典解释\"><ruby>翦<rt>jiǎn</rt></ruby></span></span>纸如镜,黏壁间。<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"俄顷\" data-note=\"一会儿。\" title=\"一会儿。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“俄顷”的词典解释\"><ruby>俄顷<rt>é qǐng</rt></ruby></span></span>,月明辉室,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"光鉴毫芒\" data-note=\"光亮到细小毫毛都能照见。\" title=\"光亮到细小毫毛都能照见。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“光鉴毫芒”的词典解释\"><ruby>光鉴毫芒<rt>guāng jiàn háo máng</rt></ruby></span></span>。诸门人环听奔走。一客曰:“<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"良宵\" data-note=\"美好的夜晚。\" title=\"美好的夜晚。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“良宵”的词典解释\"><ruby>良宵<rt>liáng xiāo</rt></ruby></span></span>胜乐,不可不同。”<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"乃\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“乃”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：nǎi 古文代词或连词，文中多作你们的、于是等义。\">乃</span>于案上取壶酒,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"分赉\" data-note=\"分赏、赐予。\" title=\"分赏、赐予。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“分赉”的词典解释\"><ruby>分赉<rt>fēn lài</rt></ruby></span></span>诸徒,且嘱尽醉。王自思:七八人,壶酒何能遍给?遂各觅<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"盎盂\" data-note=\"盛酒食的器皿。\" title=\"盛酒食的器皿。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“盎盂”的词典解释\"><ruby>盎盂<rt>àng yú</rt></ruby></span></span>,竞饮先<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"釂\" data-note=\"饮尽杯中酒。\" title=\"饮尽杯中酒。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“釂”的词典解释\"><ruby>釂<rt>jiào</rt></ruby></span></span>,惟恐<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"樽\" data-note=\"酒器。\" title=\"酒器。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“樽”的词典解释\"><ruby>樽<rt>zūn</rt></ruby></span></span>尽。而往复<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"挹注\" data-note=\"舀取倾注。\" title=\"舀取倾注。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“挹注”的词典解释\"><ruby>挹注<rt>yì zhù</rt></ruby></span></span>,竟不少减。心奇之。俄一客曰:“<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"蒙\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“蒙”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：méng 《易经》卦名，坎下艮上。\">蒙</span>赐月明之照,<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"乃\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“乃”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：nǎi 古文代词或连词，文中多作你们的、于是等义。\">乃</span>尔寂饮,何不呼<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"嫦娥\" data-note=\"月宫仙女。\" title=\"月宫仙女。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“嫦娥”的词典解释\"><ruby>嫦娥<rt>cháng é</rt></ruby></span></span>来?”<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"乃\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“乃”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：nǎi 古文代词或连词，文中多作你们的、于是等义。\">乃</span>以<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"箸\" data-note=\"筷子。\" title=\"筷子。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“箸”的词典解释\"><ruby>箸<rt>zhù</rt></ruby></span></span>掷月中,见一美人,自光中出,初不<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"盈尺\" data-note=\"满一尺。\" title=\"满一尺。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“盈尺”的词典解释\"><ruby>盈尺<rt>yíng chǐ</rt></ruby></span></span>,至地,遂与人等。<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"纤腰\" data-note=\"细腰。\" title=\"细腰。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“纤腰”的词典解释\"><ruby>纤腰<rt>xiān yāo</rt></ruby></span></span><span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"秀项\" data-note=\"秀美的颈项。\" title=\"秀美的颈项。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“秀项”的词典解释\"><ruby>秀项<rt>xiù xiàng</rt></ruby></span></span>,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"翩翩\" data-note=\"轻快飘逸的样子。\" title=\"轻快飘逸的样子。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“翩翩”的词典解释\"><ruby>翩翩<rt>piān piān</rt></ruby></span></span>作《<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"霓裳\" data-note=\"《霓裳羽衣舞》的省称。\" title=\"《霓裳羽衣舞》的省称。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“霓裳”的词典解释\"><ruby>霓裳<rt>ní cháng</rt></ruby></span></span>舞》。已而歌曰:“仙仙乎,而还乎,而幽我于广寒乎!”其声<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"清越\" data-note=\"声音清脆高扬。\" title=\"声音清脆高扬。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“清越”的词典解释\"><ruby>清越<rt>qīng yuè</rt></ruby></span></span>,烈如<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"箫管\" data-note=\"箫笛一类乐器。\" title=\"箫笛一类乐器。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“箫管”的词典解释\"><ruby>箫管<rt>xiāo guǎn</rt></ruby></span></span>。歌毕,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"盘旋\" data-note=\"回旋。\" title=\"回旋。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“盘旋”的词典解释\"><ruby>盘旋<rt>pán xuán</rt></ruby></span></span>而起,跃<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"登\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“登”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：dēng 古代盛放祭品的礼器。\">登</span>几上,惊顾之间,已复为箸。三人大笑。又一客曰:“今宵最乐,然<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"不胜酒力\" data-note=\"承受不住酒力。\" title=\"承受不住酒力。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“不胜酒力”的词典解释\"><ruby>不胜酒力<rt>bù shèng jiǔ lì</rt></ruby></span></span>矣。其<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"饯\" data-note=\"设酒食送行。\" title=\"设酒食送行。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“饯”的词典解释\"><ruby>饯<rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></span></span>我于月宫可乎?”三人移席,渐入月中。众视三人,坐月中饮,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"须眉\" data-note=\"胡须和眉毛。\" title=\"胡须和眉毛。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“须眉”的词典解释\"><ruby>须眉<rt>xū méi</rt></ruby></span></span>毕见,如影之在镜中。<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"移时\" data-note=\"过了一段时间。\" title=\"过了一段时间。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“移时”的词典解释\"><ruby>移时<rt>yí shí</rt></ruby></span></span>,月渐暗。门人然烛来,则道士独坐而客<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"杳\" data-note=\"不见踪影。\" title=\"不见踪影。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“杳”的词典解释\"><ruby>杳<rt>yǎo</rt></ruby></span></span>矣。几上<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"肴核\" data-note=\"菜肴和果品。\" title=\"菜肴和果品。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“肴核”的词典解释\"><ruby>肴核<rt>yáo hé</rt></ruby></span></span>尚存,壁上月,纸圆如镜而已。道士问众:“饮足乎?”曰:“足矣。”“足宜早寝,勿误<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"樵苏\" data-note=\"砍柴割草；泛指劳作。\" title=\"砍柴割草；泛指劳作。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“樵苏”的词典解释\"><ruby>樵苏<rt>qiáo sū</rt></ruby></span></span>。”众诺而退。王窃<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"忻慕\" data-note=\"喜悦羡慕。\" title=\"喜悦羡慕。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“忻慕”的词典解释\"><ruby>忻慕<rt>xīn mù</rt></ruby></span></span>,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"归念\" data-note=\"回家的念头。\" title=\"回家的念头。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“归念”的词典解释\"><ruby>归念<rt>guī niàn</rt></ruby></span></span>遂息。\n又一月,苦不可忍,而道士并不传教一术。心不能待,辞曰:“弟子数百里<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"受业\" data-note=\"从师学习。\" title=\"从师学习。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“受业”的词典解释\"><ruby>受业<rt>shòu yè</rt></ruby></span></span>仙师,纵不能得长生术,或小有<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"传习\" data-note=\"传授学习。\" title=\"传授学习。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“传习”的词典解释\"><ruby>传习<rt>chuán xí</rt></ruby></span></span>,亦可慰求教之心。今阅两三月,不过早樵而暮归。弟子在家,未<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"谙\" data-note=\"熟悉、知道。\" title=\"熟悉、知道。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“谙”的词典解释\"><ruby>谙<rt>ān</rt></ruby></span></span>此苦。”道士笑曰:“我固谓不能作苦,今果然。明早当<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"遣\" data-note=\"打发、送走。\" title=\"打发、送走。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“遣”的词典解释\"><ruby>遣<rt>qiǎn</rt></ruby></span></span><span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"汝\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“汝”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：rǔ 古文第二人称代词，你、你们。\">汝</span>行。”王曰:“弟子操作多日,师略授小技,此来为不负也。”道士问:“何术之求?”王曰:“每见师行处,墙壁所不能隔,但得此法足矣。”道士笑而允之。<span class=\"global-term-anchor\" data-global-term=\"乃\" data-difficulty=\"4\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看全书词典中“乃”的释义\" title=\"全书词典：nǎi 古文代词或连词，文中多作你们的、于是等义。\">乃</span>传以<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"诀\" data-note=\"口诀、法诀。\" title=\"口诀、法诀。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“诀”的词典解释\"><ruby>诀<rt>jué</rt></ruby></span></span>,令自<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"咒\" data-note=\"念咒语。\" title=\"念咒语。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“咒”的词典解释\"><ruby>咒<rt>zhòu</rt></ruby></span></span>毕,呼曰:“入之!”王面墙不敢入。又曰:“试入之。”王果<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"从容\" data-note=\"不慌不忙。\" title=\"不慌不忙。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“从容”的词典解释\"><ruby>从容<rt>cóng róng</rt></ruby></span></span>入,及墙而阻。道士曰:“<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"俯首\" data-note=\"低头。\" title=\"低头。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“俯首”的词典解释\"><ruby>俯首<rt>fǔ shǒu</rt></ruby></span></span><span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"骤入\" data-note=\"快速进入。\" title=\"快速进入。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“骤入”的词典解释\"><ruby>骤入<rt>zhòu rù</rt></ruby></span></span>,勿<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"逡巡\" data-note=\"迟疑徘徊。\" title=\"迟疑徘徊。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“逡巡”的词典解释\"><ruby>逡巡<rt>qūn xún</rt></ruby></span></span>!”王果去墙数步,奔而入,及墙,虚若无物,回视,果在墙外矣。大喜,入谢。道士曰:“归宜<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"洁持\" data-note=\"保持清白操守。\" title=\"保持清白操守。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“洁持”的词典解释\"><ruby>洁持<rt>jié chí</rt></ruby></span></span>,否则不验。”遂助<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"资斧\" data-note=\"旅费、盘缠。\" title=\"旅费、盘缠。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“资斧”的词典解释\"><ruby>资斧<rt>zī fǔ</rt></ruby></span></span>遣之归。\n抵家,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"自诩\" data-note=\"自夸。\" title=\"自夸。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“自诩”的词典解释\"><ruby>自诩<rt>zì xǔ</rt></ruby></span></span>遇仙,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"坚壁\" data-note=\"坚固的墙壁。\" title=\"坚固的墙壁。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“坚壁”的词典解释\"><ruby>坚壁<rt>jiān bì</rt></ruby></span></span>所不能阻。妻不信。王效其作为,去墙数尺,奔而入,头触硬壁,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"蓦然\" data-note=\"忽然。\" title=\"忽然。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“蓦然”的词典解释\"><ruby>蓦然<rt>mò rán</rt></ruby></span></span>而<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"踣\" data-note=\"跌倒。\" title=\"跌倒。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“踣”的词典解释\"><ruby>踣<rt>bó</rt></ruby></span></span>。妻扶视之,额上<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"坟起\" data-note=\"隆起、肿起。\" title=\"隆起、肿起。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“坟起”的词典解释\"><ruby>坟起<rt>fén qǐ</rt></ruby></span></span>,如巨卵焉。妻<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"揶揄\" data-note=\"嘲笑、戏弄。\" title=\"嘲笑、戏弄。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“揶揄”的词典解释\"><ruby>揶揄<rt>yé yú</rt></ruby></span></span>之。王<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"惭忿\" data-note=\"惭愧而愤怒。\" title=\"惭愧而愤怒。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“惭忿”的词典解释\"><ruby>惭忿<rt>cán fèn</rt></ruby></span></span>,骂老道士之无良而已。\n<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"异史氏\" data-note=\"蒲松龄在《聊斋志异》中的自称。\" title=\"蒲松龄在《聊斋志异》中的自称。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“异史氏”的词典解释\"><ruby>异史氏<rt>yì shǐ shì</rt></ruby></span></span>曰:闻此事未有不大笑者,而不知世之为王生者,正复不少。今有<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"伧父\" data-note=\"粗鄙之人。\" title=\"粗鄙之人。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“伧父”的词典解释\"><ruby>伧父<rt>cāng fǔ</rt></ruby></span></span>,喜<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"疢毒\" data-note=\"病害毒物；比喻有害之物。\" title=\"病害毒物；比喻有害之物。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“疢毒”的词典解释\"><ruby>疢毒<rt>chèn dú</rt></ruby></span></span>而畏<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"药石\" data-note=\"药物和砭石；泛指治病之物。\" title=\"药物和砭石；泛指治病之物。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“药石”的词典解释\"><ruby>药石<rt>yào shí</rt></ruby></span></span>,遂有<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"舐痈吮痔\" data-note=\"比喻卑劣逢迎。\" title=\"比喻卑劣逢迎。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“舐痈吮痔”的词典解释\"><ruby>舐痈吮痔<rt>shì yōng shǔn zhì</rt></ruby></span></span>者,进<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"宣威逞暴\" data-note=\"炫耀威势、逞弄暴力。\" title=\"炫耀威势、逞弄暴力。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“宣威逞暴”的词典解释\"><ruby>宣威逞暴<rt>xuān wēi chěng bào</rt></ruby></span></span>之术,以迎其旨,<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"诒\" data-note=\"欺骗；也作“贻”。\" title=\"欺骗；也作“贻”。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“诒”的词典解释\"><ruby>诒<rt>yí</rt></ruby></span></span>之曰:“执此术也以往,可以横行而<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"无碍\" data-note=\"没有阻碍。\" title=\"没有阻碍。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“无碍”的词典解释\"><ruby>无碍<rt>wú ài</rt></ruby></span></span>。”初试未尝不<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"小效\" data-note=\"小的效果。\" title=\"小的效果。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“小效”的词典解释\"><ruby>小效<rt>xiǎo xiào</rt></ruby></span></span>,遂谓天下之大,举可以如是行矣,势不至触硬壁而<span class=\"notation auto-notation\" data-term=\"颠蹶\" data-note=\"跌倒；也比喻失败受挫。\" title=\"跌倒；也比喻失败受挫。\"><span class=\"term-anchor\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"查看“颠蹶”的词典解释\"><ruby>颠蹶<rt>diān jué</rt></ruby></span></span>不止也。</p><figure class=\"inline-media\" data-media-id=\"ecc2cd8a-2f14-4807-8bcd-56612214b021\" data-size=\"medium\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img data-media-id=\"ecc2cd8a-2f14-4807-8bcd-56612214b021\" alt=\"26.jpg\"><figcaption contenteditable=\"true\" data-placeholder=\"图片说明（可选）\" aria-label=\"图片说明\"></figcaption><div class=\"inline-media-tools\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button type=\"button\">小</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"active\">中</button><button type=\"button\">大</button><button type=\"button\">全宽</button><button type=\"button\">删除图片</button></div></figure><figure class=\"inline-media\" data-media-id=\"f1986910-867d-4add-88aa-aa506ace56ed\" data-size=\"medium\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img data-media-id=\"f1986910-867d-4add-88aa-aa506ace56ed\" alt=\"25.jpg\"><figcaption contenteditable=\"true\" data-placeholder=\"图片说明（可选）\" aria-label=\"图片说明\"></figcaption><div class=\"inline-media-tools\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button type=\"button\">小</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"active\">中</button><button type=\"button\">大</button><button type=\"button\">全宽</button><button type=\"button\">删除图片</button></div></figure>",
